    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Loot</strong> is an online co-op sci-fi looting game filled with chaos, animal pirates, limited oxygen, and unpredictable dangers. You and up to three friends will dive into derelict space wrecks, grab everything that isn't nailed down, and try to make it back in one piece\u2014ideally, with all of your limbs still attached.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/64924d9ef1aea1a4f263cb20a4809e17.poster.avif?t=1753453036\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/64924d9ef1aea1a4f263cb20a4809e17.webm?t=1753453036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/64924d9ef1aea1a4f263cb20a4809e17.mp4?t=1753453036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\ude80 WHO YOU ARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re a contract looter for a shady space pirate syndicate.</strong><br>Alongside your questionable animal crewmates, your mission is simple: raid abandoned space wrecks, snatch as much loot as you can carry, and make it back before your oxygen or time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/f4a1f25c06d4e5f8b48518123f5760e7.poster.avif?t=1753453036\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/f4a1f25c06d4e5f8b48518123f5760e7.webm?t=1753453036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/f4a1f25c06d4e5f8b48518123f5760e7.mp4?t=1753453036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 WHAT YOU DO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suit up, pick a wreck, and dive in.</strong><br>Each location offers procedurally generated layouts, creepy ambient threats, and an ever-ticking timer. Oxygen tanks deplete. Traps wait around every corner. The deeper the station, the better the loot\u2014and the worse the odds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa4 HOW YOU SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication and chaos go hand in hand.</strong><br>Use proximity voice chat to coordinate\u2014or sabotage\u2014your crew. Carry oversized loot as a team, revive fallen pirates with rare tools, and avoid getting vaporized by a teammate\u2019s <i>accidental</i> laser trap trigger. This isn\u2019t a solo job... unless you want to die alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/2ff246904debaefd513f73af417f7c07.poster.avif?t=1753453036\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/2ff246904debaefd513f73af417f7c07.webm?t=1753453036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/2ff246904debaefd513f73af417f7c07.mp4?t=1753453036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 WHY YOU KEEP GOING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Profit buys power\u2014and pointless junk.</strong><br>Sell what you recover to upgrade your ship\u2019s core systems, unlock stronger gear, and access more dangerous missions. Or blow it all on useless (but hilarious) space junk, like a glowing llama or a toilet that sings sea shanties.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Loot</strong> is an online co-op sci-fi looting game filled with chaos, animal pirates, limited oxygen, and unpredictable dangers. You and up to three friends will dive into derelict space wrecks, grab everything that isn't nailed down, and try to make it back in one piece\u2014ideally, with all of your limbs still attached.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/64924d9ef1aea1a4f263cb20a4809e17.poster.avif?t=1753453036\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/64924d9ef1aea1a4f263cb20a4809e17.webm?t=1753453036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/64924d9ef1aea1a4f263cb20a4809e17.mp4?t=1753453036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\ude80 WHO YOU ARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re a contract looter for a shady space pirate syndicate.</strong><br>Alongside your questionable animal crewmates, your mission is simple: raid abandoned space wrecks, snatch as much loot as you can carry, and make it back before your oxygen or time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/f4a1f25c06d4e5f8b48518123f5760e7.poster.avif?t=1753453036\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659130/extras/f4a1f25c06d4e5f8b48518123f5760e7.webm?t=1753453036\" type=\"video/we